        "description": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Trigger:</em> While the ochre jelly is Large or Medium and has 10+ Hit Points, it becomes Bloodied or is subjected to Lightning or Slashing damage. </p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Response:</em> The ochre jelly splits into two new <strong>Ochre Jelly</strong>. Each new ochre jelly is one size smaller than the original ochre jelly and acts on its Initiative. The original ochre jelly's Hit Points are divided evenly between the new ochre jellys (round down).</p>",
